Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 只是宝宝踢了一下而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you! It was just a kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对啊  对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh right! Right, oh wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真把你老爸吓死了! 瞧老爸傻的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh you really gave daddy a scare! Daddy got silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸我从悬崖上溜下来 然后就嘣 嘣 嘣! 傻老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy fall down cliff and go, boom, boom, boom. Silly daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 各位 虚惊一样 宝宝只是提了一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, folks. False alarm. It was just a kick.{\r}
