Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜 你会是个好妈妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad, you'd make a wonderful mother.{\r}
