Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等…迪亚戈哪去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second... Where is Diego?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是蹄下生风啊 宝贝儿! 蹄下生风!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hooves are burning, baby! They are burning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 瞧啊 我踮脚跑 我踮脚跑! 你就吃灰去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look at this, I got to tip-Toe! I got to tip-Toe! Eat my dust, dingo!{\r}
