Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子好得很 我现在倒是担心他老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The baby is fine. It's the freaked out daddy I'm worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别偷看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah-Uh-Uh, No peeking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗒嗒! 游乐场在此… - 哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Voila! Playground for junior... - Ohh wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼… - 这是我做的 我们全家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ohh Manny... - I made it myself, our family.{\r}
