Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然可以 谁让我是地球上个儿最大的呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I can, I'm the biggest thing on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 大块头老爹 我真想看看 你能怎么应付小娃娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay big daddy, I can't wait to see, how you handle the teen years.{\r}
