Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这下可好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh great!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody here? Anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 ?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:12:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 可怜的小家伙 我知道被人抛弃的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh poor guys, I know what it's like to feel abandoned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 你们不再孤独了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, you're not alone anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖呆好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呆在这! 照顾好你弟弟 妈妈马上回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here! You take care of your brother now, momma's coming right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,宝宝 妈妈来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Momma's coming, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,接到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才怎么跟你说的? 倒霉孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I just tell you kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢 谢谢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh, thank you, thank you, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,坏蛋 大坏蛋 你们真快把妈妈吓出心脏病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad eggs, rotten eggs. A heart attack you almost gave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对不起 小宝宝 我只是太爱你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh I'm sorry darling, it's just that I love you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 来见见你们曼尼叔叔和艾丽婶婶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, l want you to meet your Uncle Manny and your Aunt Ellie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你们介绍 蛋蛋 蛋壳 蛋黄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to present, Eggbert, Shelly and Yoko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,希德 不管你在干什么 都不是好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid, whatever you're doing. It's a bad idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘! 孩子们会听到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh! My kids will hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.49,0:14:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是你的孩子 希德 哪拿的放哪去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not your kids, Sid. Take them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不适合当家长 - 凭什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not meant to be a parent. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 你偷蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First sign: stealing someone else's eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,其次 有个差点成了煎蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second sign: one of them almost became an omelet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,希德 蛋妈妈肯定在急着找他们呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid, someone must be worried sick looking for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 他们是在地下的冰洞里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they were underground, in ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.55,0:15:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是我发现了 他们早就成… 冰蛋蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it wasn't for me they'd be... Egg sickles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,希德 我知道你有多难受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid, I know what your going through. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 你会成家立业的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have a family too someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你会遇上个好女孩… 她要求不高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna meet a nice girl, with... with low standards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,也没的挑 或者有点味道…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no real options, or sense of smell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼的意思是… - 别说了 我明白 我送他们回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What Manny means to say is... - No, I get it. I'll take them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去过两人世界 我只能孤苦伶仃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have your family and I'm better off alone. By myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,呆在我的"孤独城堡"里 (超人在南极的家){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fortress of solitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呆在冰天雪地里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the ice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,永不超生!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人 孤单寂寞…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alone, lonely loner..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- "一个人"还真不少 - 没错!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a lot of aloners. - Precisely!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希德 等下 - 不用叫他 没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sid, wait. - No, no, it's ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:16:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他会自己蹦回来的 这也算是希德的一样特异功能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll bounce back, it's one of the advantages of being Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么一定要把你们放回去呢 我喜欢小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I take you back. I love kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我又有责任心 又有爱心 还有细心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm responsible, loving, nurturing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们说呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你们也这么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you would agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 别哭 别哭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh oh, don't cry! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你们找个干燥的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find a dry place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你擦擦干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me just dry you off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢 当家长 责任太大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, being a parents, a lot of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我是没准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 妈妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mamma, mama, mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我当妈咪了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妈咪在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 把小脸洗的干干净净{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, nice clean faces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我来接 我来接!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it! I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 别舔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.81,0:19:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 不准咬!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no biting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 哦 没事了 都没事了 别哭哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, no, it's okay, it's okay. Don't cry! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么还哭 你们饿了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you still crying? Are you hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.85,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,, 应该是饿了 我知道上哪儿找吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Maybe your hungry. I know just the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别出声 牛妈妈在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hush, hush, You mean, vicious animal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是你的牛宝宝 来吃奶奶了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your baby and this is my milk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahhhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你是母的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were a female!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉哦 可你们不让进的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but you can't go in. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼说 只给小孩子玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Manny says, It's just for kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等下…你们就是小孩子呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute... You are kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,记得别碰坏东西!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't break anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,树懒说游乐场开放了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sloth says the playground's open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 不是全部开放!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait. Not for everyone!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别碰那个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Don't touch that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是什么动物?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,管他呢 有趣就是了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Who cares? Their fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈咪 他占着这个不让我玩 - 你是不是该说说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy, his not sharing. - Aren't you gonna do something. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,, 本来就是我家孩子先抢到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?  My kid had it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是! - 就是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did not! - Did to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人骗人 没羞没羞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liar,liar,pants on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪根筋不对啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是带着三个娃娃的单身母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a single mother with 3 kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你给点同情会死人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use a little compassion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.87,0:22:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别那么玩! - 别玩了! 停下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No don't! - No, don't! Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.61,0:22:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小罗罗! - 哇 太炫了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ronald! - Whoa! That's insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 停下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坚持住 小强强! - 我在坚持!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on, Little Johnny! - I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,知道不 专家说过 孩子想吃什么 就该让他吃什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, experts say that you should let the kids eat whatever they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.36,0:22:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我脚脖子粗吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think my ankles look fat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,脚脖子 在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ankles. What ankles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:23:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小罗 你从哪飞来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ronald, Where did you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.31,0:23:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh No!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快点 吐出来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay come on spit him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,, 你要是不把小强吐出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't spit out Little Johnny{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.69,0:23:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我就带你走了 立马带走 1…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're leaving the playground this instantly, one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,, 一…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,二…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可别逼我数3哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me say three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,, 这不出来了 活蹦乱跳的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we are, a picture of health. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.05,0:23:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是小强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not little Johnny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有总比没有强嘛 - 小曼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well better than nothing. - Madison!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.35,0:23:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 吐出来 - 希德!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, barf him up! - Sid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 曼尼 - 小强强!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello, Manny. - Little Johnny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 别…不要啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh wait... No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I'm really sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.93,0:23:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这地儿全毁了 - 可不是我们干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This place is totalled. - And we didn't reck it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.23,0:23:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们没机会玩了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing our touch bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,最重要的是 没人受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The important thing is that no one got hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,除了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Except for that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.88,0:24:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那三个…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, and those three... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你把他们带回去 可你却留着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to take them back, and you kept them! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.29,0:24:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看看现在这团糟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look what they've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我同意 他们是有点不听话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay granted, we do have some discipline issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.01,0:24:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,吃人家小孩可不止是不听话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eating kids is not a discipline issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.45,0:24:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可他也吐出来了啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he spit them out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.80,0:24:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那真了不起啊 再给他发朵大红花吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's super, lets give him a gold star! Kid of the week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不属于这里 希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't belong here, Sid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管他们是什么 也不管从哪儿来 你给我送回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Whatever they are wherever you found them, take them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.79,0:24:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼 我可不会抛下我孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, I'm not getting rid of my kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,地震了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earthquake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没事没事 有妈妈在!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Okay, It's okay, mamma's here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.45,0:24:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,地震还会叫唤吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do earthquakes, shriek?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这些家伙都灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought those guys were extinct. !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.09,0:25:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那这家伙 就是头发飙的活化石了 希德!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then, that is one angry fossil. Sid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.23,0:25:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快 进去 都进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, inside, inside, inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.89,0:25:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都别动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move a muscle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.99,0:26:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别别 别哭啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, don't cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.72,0:26:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是迷途的小羊羔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are poor little lambs who have lost our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.61,0:26:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,希德! 把孩子们还给她 她才是妈妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid! Give them to her. She's their mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.60,0:26:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道 她不是冒牌的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I know, she's their mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.64,0:26:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想怎么 看出生证吗? 她是头恐龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want, a birth certificate? She's a Dinosaur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.19,0:26:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我含辛茹苦 一把屎一把尿地把他们拉扯大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I've put in the, blood, sweat and tears to raise them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.98,0:26:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,才一天! 快把孩子还给她 疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} For a day! Give them back, you Lunatic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.01,0:26:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 这是我的孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look these are my kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.20,0:27:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,想抢孩子 先过我这关!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your gonna have to go through me to get them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.08,0:27:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希德! - 救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sid! - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.61,0:27:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跑路啊! - 你吃饱了撑的吗 这么没追求?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run! - Don't you have anything better to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.34,0:27:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,, 希德?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.47,0:27:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,希德肯定是被带下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid must be down there. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.60,0:27:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 他肯定是完了 - 真可惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, his dead! - Real shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.69,0:27:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们会想念他的 - 别这么早下定论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He will be missed. - Oh no, no, no. Not so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 接下来我就一个人去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Ellie, this is where I draw the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.99,0:27:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你 喀什 艾迪 回村子里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, Crash and Eddie back to the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.57,0:28:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah that's gonna happen. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽! 你没看到那玩意吗? 这一路会很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie! You saw that thing? This is gonna be dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就说给我鼻子听吧 - 哦 太棒了 等我们救出希德 我非宰了他不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Talk to the trunk. - Oh great, after we save Sid! I'm gonna kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 女士优先 - 先老后美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ladies first! - Age before beauty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.47,0:28:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先苦后甜 - 什么苦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No pain no gain! - What pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.43,0:28:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希德? - 希德?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sid? - Sid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.88,0:28:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不妙啊不妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no, no, no! Not good. Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽! 艾丽! 等下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie! Ellie! Wait up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,先说好 你要是觉得不对劲 就算是错觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay look, if you feel anything, even if it's nothing. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也一定要告诉我 我们就立马出去 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You gotta tell me. And we're outta here. - OK{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.27,0:29:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,咱得先想个代号 嗯 来表示"要生孩子了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a code word. Yeah, something that says, "the baby's coming."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.99,0:29:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 这个怎么样 "啊! 要生了! "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. How about, "Aaah! The baby's coming!" How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不成 太长了 我们得想个短小精悍的 比如…呃…"桃子"!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, too long. We need something short and punchy, like, uh... "peaches"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 桃子? - 我喜欢桃子 它们又甜又圆 还毛茸茸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peaches? - I love peaches, they're sweet and round and fuzzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.37,0:29:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就跟你一样 - 你说我长得圆?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just like you. - You think I'm round?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.80,0:29:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…圆的好啊 圆显得 肉感(性感)!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhh... Round is good. Round is, foxy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,都跟紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.84,0:30:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们是不是在跟我做同一个梦? - 原来我们的脚下 一直还有另一个世界!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you guys havin' the same dream I am? - We've been living above an entire world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.29,0:30:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,却根本不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we didn't even know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.18,0:30:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run for it! Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.19,0:30:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迪亚戈 你怎么在这? - 观光呢 找希德 跟你一样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diego, what are you doing here? - Sight seeing. Looking for Sid, same as you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.61,0:30:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还真是高尚 - 现在不是拌嘴的时候 我们需要人手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well aren't you noble. - This is not the time guys. We need all the help we can get!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.77,0:31:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是算了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.14,0:31:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到这儿来 真乖乖! 快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, boy. Here, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.46,0:31:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗! 我们可不会爬在那东西上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you nuts! We're not getting on that thing! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要嘛是这头恐龙 要嘛就是那头 自己挑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's either this dinosaur, or that one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.80,0:31:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,孕妇来也 借个路!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pregnant lady, wants a lift. Yabba, dabba, Do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.81,0:31:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以后别再这么干!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever, yabba, dabba, do that again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.57,0:31:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得自己好…小啊 - 那你知道我现在怎么想吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I feel so... puny. - How do you think I feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.73,0:32:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,找好掩护!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.67,0:33:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老大 太崇拜你了! 你就是我亲哥哥! - 我也这么觉得!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dude, you're awesome! You're like the brother I never had! - Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.19,0:33:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能收下他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we keep him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.67,0:33:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴克 - 啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buck. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.08,0:33:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫巴克 是"巴克大侠"的简称{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name's Buck. Short for, Buck-Minster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是"吧! "的全称{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long for, buh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.68,0:33:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有点钝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little dull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.02,0:33:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们来这干什么? - 我们一朋友被恐龙抓了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here? - Our friend was taken by a dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.16,0:33:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是嘛 他挂了 欢迎来到我的世界 然后 嗯 回家去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, his dead. Welcome to my world. Now, uh, go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.82,0:33:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就不送了! - 不找到希德 我们就不走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Off you pop! - Not without, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.85,0:34:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽 等等 或许这个秀逗家伙说的有理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie wait, maybe the deranged hermit has a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.38,0:34:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼! 我们都走了这么远了 一定能找到他的 - 我发现线索了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manny! We came this far, we're gonna find him. - I got tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.77,0:34:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们进去了 等找到朋友 就已经是…下辈子的事了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go in there, you'll find your friend... in the AFTER-LIFE!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.44,0:34:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道? 这位伟大智慧的黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know? Oh great and wisely, weasely one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.02,0:34:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙妈妈叼着三只小恐龙 还有一个软绵绵的绿东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mummy dinosaur carrying three babies, and some floppy green thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.86,0:34:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 那个软绵绵的绿东西就是我们朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we're friends with the floppy green thing. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.43,0:34:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你光看脚印就知道这么多?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got all that from the tracks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.24,0:34:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,错 我之前看到他们经过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really. I saw 'em come through here earlier. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.02,0:34:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,她往"熔岩瀑布"去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's headed for Lava Falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在那养小恐龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where they care, for the newborns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.69,0:34:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要想到那儿 你就得穿过"悲惨森林"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get there! You got to go through the jungle of misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.89,0:34:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,横渡"死亡峡谷"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Across the chasm of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.97,0:34:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 直抵"惊呼之地" - 哇! ! !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To the plates of wow. - Wow!!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你就自己慢慢疯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! Good luck with the slow decadence to madness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.97,0:35:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.32,0:35:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.88,0:35:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你们是来热带旅游吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you-You think this is some sort of tropical getaway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.22,0:35:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本保护不了你老婆! 老兄!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't protect your mate! Mate!.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.60,0:35:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你能干什么 嗯? 就靠这些脆生生的小象牙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do with those-Those flimsy tusks..?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.80,0:35:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是碰上那头怪物呢 怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you run into the Beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫他"鲁迪"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call him "Rudy".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.33,0:35:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 就这样啊 我还以为会更吓人点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh good. Good. I was worried it was something intimidating...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.24,0:35:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,比如"小强" "小黄"之类的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like, Sheldon or Tim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.06,0:35:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等等! 你是说 有什么东西比母恐龙还大?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! You mean there's something *bigger* than Mommy Dinosaur..?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.95,0:35:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,正是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 正是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye? - Aye! Aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.20,0:35:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的这个 就是拜他所赐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one that gave me this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.19,0:35:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 这个眼罩是他给的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. He gave you that patch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.56,0:35:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 免费的? - 太酷了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For free?  - That's so cool. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.90,0:35:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定 他也会送给我们一对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Yeah, maybe he'll give *us* one, too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.19,0:35:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to my world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 擅闯禁地者 全无希望! - 好了 知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Abandon all hope, he who enters there! - Alright we get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.97,0:36:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有厄运与绝望相伴…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doom and despair. Yadda, yadda, yadda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.26,0:37:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来 还真是个"悲惨森林"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a jungle of misery to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.94,0:37:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等下 - 怎么了 出什么事了 是来"桃子"了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on. - Why, what's wrong? Peaches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.84,0:37:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我只是觉得有点怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's just I got a funny feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.17,0:37:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿了吧 哦 低血糖!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} You're hungry. Low blood sugar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.47,0:37:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那儿有果子 - 曼尼 别去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's some fruit. - No, Manny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.43,0:37:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是你 可不会乱摘东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that, if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.90,0:37:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可不是你熟悉的地盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't exactly your playground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.27,0:38:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好像我会怕小花小草似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I'm going to be afraid of a pretty flower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.34,0:38:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才可没料到这个吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bet you didn't see that coming? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.44,0:38:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Manny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,郑重申明 这全都怪你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record, I blame you for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.20,0:38:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不准吃我们的朋友 大花怪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop eating our friends, plant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 我要把你连根拔起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, I'm tearing it up, from the roots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.50,0:38:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要这么干 花瓣就会一直合着  - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do that and it'll clamp-Shut forever. - What ?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.49,0:38:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 孕妇同志 别吓的鼻子都打结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, preggers. Don't get your trunk in a knot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.15,0:38:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来把他们弄出来 乘还没被消化 - 消化?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll have them out of there before they're digested. - Digested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.68,0:38:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,过个三分钟 他们除了骨头可就什么都不剩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be nothing but bones in 3 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个胖的可能得五分钟 - 我不胖!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well maybe 5 for the fat one! - I'm not fat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么觉得有点酥麻啊 - 别说这种话 你还贴着我呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I feel tingly. - Don't say that, when your pressed up against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.21,0:38:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是那种酥麻 - 啊 我也酥麻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not that kind of tingly. - I can feel it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.84,0:38:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命 来人啊! - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help, someone help us! - Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.38,0:38:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看我巴克的手段!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to get... Buck wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.28,0:39:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在知道谁胖了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's fat now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.58,0:39:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.74,0:40:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一群观光客 - 被朵花吐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tourists. - Puked on by a plant. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.15,0:40:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太炫了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.27,0:40:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快说话呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.40,0:40:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank's for saving us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.73,0:40:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能帮我们找那个"软绵绵的绿东西"吗? - 我们用不着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you help us find the floppy green thing? - That's not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.31,0:40:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.72,0:40:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我帮你 可我有规矩 第一:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright I'll help ya. But I got rules. Rule number one:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.35,0:40:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,第一: 永远服从巴克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number one: Always listen to Buck. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.90,0:40:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,, 第二: 走路只走路中间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number two: Stay in the middle of the trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.82,0:40:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,第三:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Rule number three:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.58,0:40:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,爱放屁的 自觉到队尾去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He who has gas, trave ls at the back of the pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.91,0:40:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 都跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on then, chop, chop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.14,0:41:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真该去查查自己还正不正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should all have our heads examined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.85,0:41:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那是第四条 现在 去找你朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's rule number four. Now, let's go find your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好了 好了 不要担心 我们都会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh it's okay, it's okay. Don't worry, we're gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.02,0:41:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托不要摇了,我快吐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stop swaying. A little nauseous.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.84,0:41:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 她放我们下来了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, she's putting us down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.55,0:41:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不要! 我这么年轻 不该被吃掉啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I'm too young to be eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.20,0:41:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 这鼻涕长得真有型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Nice mucus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.29,0:41:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是人人都有啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't care for, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.23,0:42:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 这些事情是很复杂啦 也许我们能商量个办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen these things get complicated. Maybe we can work something out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.91,0:42:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,周日到周二我带? 或者周三到周五? 周末就够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can have them on Sundays to Tuesdays? Wednesdays to Fridays? Weekends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.74,0:42:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 妈妈没事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Okay, mommas okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.71,0:42:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是吃了我 对孩子们影响不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you eat me, it will send a bad message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.41,0:42:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈! 看看孩子们护着谁 我得一分!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha! Score one for the sloth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.77,0:42:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就算打的难解难分吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the scores all tied up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.07,0:42:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得那个怪物会不会找到希德? - 最主要是 会不会找到 我们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you think the beast will find, Sid? - Or more importantly, us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.11,0:43:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁迪? 开玩笑 他可是不知疲倦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rudy? Are you joking? He's relentless. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.81,0:43:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他洞察一切 吞噬一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows all, sees all eats all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.52,0:43:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's a, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.46,0:43:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 从我家草坪上滚开 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get off my lawn! Go on shoo!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.01,0:43:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙 他还是毛毛虫的时候我就认识 你知道的啦 就是他还没变态的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew that guy when he was a caterpillar. You know, before he came out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.89,0:43:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 你就这么靠智慧生存!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your just living down here by your wits! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.29,0:43:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,孤身一人 了无牵挂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All on your own, no responsibilities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.86,0:43:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就我一个! 岂不妙哉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not one! It's incredible. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.00,0:43:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有依赖 自由自在 真是每个单身汉的梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No dependence, no limits, the greatest life a single guy can have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.46,0:43:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到没? 这就是我想呆的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that? This is my kind of place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.45,0:43:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,喂? 不行啊 现在不方便说话…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? No... No I can't really talk right now... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.58,0:43:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,, 我得去给个死树懒收尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I'm trying to recover a dead sloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.30,0:43:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这会 那帮人还跟着我呢! 就是说! 他们还以为我疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, They're following Me! I know! They think I'm crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.59,0:43:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好了…我们快到"死亡峡谷"了 信号不好 快断了 我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay... We're going into the Chasm of Death, I'm gonna lose you. I love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.95,0:44:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也爱你 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you too. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.99,0:44:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 再见 白白 白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, goodbye. Goodbye, bye. O{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.96,0:44:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 都跟上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.91,0:44:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是你三个星期以后的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's you in three weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.14,0:44:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 他们干嘛管这个叫"死亡峡谷"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why do they call it the chasm of death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.48,0:44:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也试过"大臭坑"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well we tried, 'big smelly crack'{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.60,0:44:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是…别人一听就笑 - 接下来怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But... uhh, that just made everybody giggle. - Well now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.17,0:44:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夫人… - 她可不能上这玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Madam... - She is not doing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,军规第一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.50,0:44:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想想吧 大猛犸 不是说你们挺有记性的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, mammoth. You supposed to have a good memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.08,0:44:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"永远服从巴克"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always listen to Buck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.55,0:45:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好了! 目视前方 腰板挺直…嗯 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now! Eyes forward. Back straight... and uh, yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.48,0:45:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要是吸入有毒气体 你估计就没救了 - 有毒气体?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Breathe in the toxic fumes and you'll probably die. - Toxic fumes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.81,0:45:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又一个阳光灿烂的日子 - 等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just another day in paradise. - Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.38,0:45:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,出发喽! (美国伞兵跳伞时的口语){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geronimo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.43,0:45:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾丽! 你没事吧? - 你们快来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ellie! You okay? - You have to try this. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.99,0:45:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 一个一个上 再简单不过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright now pile on everyone, couldn't be easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.31,0:45:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别慌! 只是出了点 技术故障{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't panic! Just some, technical difficulties. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.26,0:45:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,各位坚持住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Keep holding it in boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.69,0:45:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,, 我憋不住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take it anymore. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.60,0:45:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他吸气了!  我也吸气了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He breathe it. And now I'm breathing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.60,0:45:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我们没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey we're not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.35,0:45:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你听起来可真滑稽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.31,0:46:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我? 你真该听听你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? You should hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.69,0:46:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了 好了 1 2…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, alright. And one, and two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.43,0:46:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 圣诞节 圣诞节  - 你们疯了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Christmas, Christmas time is here... - Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.42,0:46:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是毒气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.65,0:46:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在麻烦大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so disturbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.41,0:46:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不准笑 统统都不准笑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop laughing, all of you! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.86,0:46:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"不准笑 统统都不准笑"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Stop laughing, all of you!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.33,0:46:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,第一条军规是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's rule number one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.07,0:46:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们只是笑一笑罢了 有那么严重吗? - 这些家伙就是笑死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're just laughing, what's so bad about that? - They died laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.68,0:46:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别笑了! - 你知道什么最好笑吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop laughing! - Do you know what's funny though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.99,0:46:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还想去救希德 可自己却先死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to save Sid and now we're all gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.90,0:47:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我甚至都不怎么喜欢希德 - 有谁喜欢呢? 他是白痴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I don't even like Sid. - Who does? He's an idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.15,0:47:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢你啊 拖我搅这趟浑水 这么多年了从来没有这样刺激过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank's for getting me into this mess. It's the most fun I've had in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你啊 玩单飞 真是牛逼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, for deserting the herd. That was totally super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.02,0:47:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咯叽咯叽咯 - 停下! 还没明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cootchie-cootchie-coo! - Stop that! Don't you see? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.00,0:47:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} We're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都得靠我们自己 对不?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta do everything, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.98,0:47:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有时候会尿床 - 别难过,有的时候,是我干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sometimes I wet my bed. - That's alright. Sometimes I wet your bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.60,0:48:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道你听到多少? - 我全都听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not sure how much of that you could hear? - Oh I heard all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.79,0:48:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在我床上尿床? - 哎呀 中毒时候说的话 怎么能当真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wet my bed? - That was, gas talk dude!.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.80,0:48:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 我们还是赶紧赶路吧 - 我们是不是忘了点什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, we better get moving. - Aren't we forgetting something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.45,0:48:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我好寂寞哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.87,0:48:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 开饭饭了…吃吧 吃吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Here you go guys... Muncher, muncher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.19,0:48:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么! 你们不吃蔬菜?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What! Your not gonna eat your vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.61,0:48:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,, 那怎么能长成强壮的大恐龙呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you going to become big and strong, dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.72,0:48:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行…我要把他们教育成素食主义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No... I raised them vegetarian. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.00,0:49:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这样更健康 我就是个最好的例子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} It's a healthier lifestyle I mean look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我看上去比实际年龄年轻多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the pelt of a much younger sloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.21,0:49:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 我跟你说话呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I'm trying to have a conversation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.53,0:49:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行! 孩子不能吃这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! That's not for us kids. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.09,0:49:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,, 这个太毛太油了 而且…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to feathery and fleshy and.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.56,0:49:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还是活的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.42,0:49:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行 我们不能吃活的动物 没得商量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, we do not eat live animals, period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.06,0:49:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快飞吧 你自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go, fly. Be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.81,0:49:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不会飞的小小鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little, flightless bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.82,0:49:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我不好 - 嘿 你去哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My bad. - Hey, where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.99,0:49:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是这么解决矛盾的? 难怪到现在也没人要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how you resolve a conflict? No wonder your single.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.33,0:50:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 拜托 我是在自言自语吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh come on. Am I talking to myself here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.13,0:50:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我说他们要吃素食 你说"吼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say they're vegetarian, you say, 'Grrrr' .{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.96,0:50:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我说我们能谈谈吗? 你说"吼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say can we talk about this? You say, Grrrr. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.40,0:50:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,算什么沟通嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't call that communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.52,0:50:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 你解决问题就这么一个老路子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's your answer to everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.19,0:50:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你还怕什么? 你是地球上最大的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you afraid of? You're the biggest thing on, Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.38,0:50:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们肯定活不成 这里白天就够危险 - 晚上就更凶险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'll never survive, it's dangerous by day! - But it's even worse at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.00,0:50:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且向导是个疯子! - 说谁呢? 巴克? 哦 他可是疯的没救了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Plus the guide is a lunatic! - What you mean, Buck? Oh his whack-O.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.92,0:50:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不是彻底的疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not. Totally bonkers! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.99,0:51:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还有香港脚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his feet smell. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.33,0:51:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴! - 你闭嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up! - You shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.82,0:51:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你个小混蛋…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you little...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.71,0:51:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在和自己的脚打架 - 我们是不是该上路了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's strangling his own foot. - Shouldn't we get moving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.71,0:51:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去给鲁迪当夜宵? 门都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And give, Rudy a midnight snack? Not likely. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.25,0:51:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这骨头说的没错 他一顿得吃N头大象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skulls right, take a load of mammals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.63,0:51:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这露营 好了 谁饿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll camp here. Now, who's hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.78,0:51:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我! - 你又不需要热量!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am. - You don't need the calories!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.25,0:51:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,当时…我的背紧贴着墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There I was... My back against the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.15,0:51:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,周围没有出路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} No way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.45,0:51:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我栖在深谷的边缘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perched on a razor's edge of oblivion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.96,0:51:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,突然 看到了一双眼睛 一头白色庞然大物的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Staring into the eye, of the great white beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.16,0:52:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你死了吗? - 悲惨的是 我死了 但我还是活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Were you killed? - Sadly, yes. But I lived!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.35,0:52:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未如此强烈地感受到生命 直到我如此近距离地接触…死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never had I felt so alive, than when I was so close... To death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.70,0:52:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,转眼间 鲁迪就会把我咽下喉咙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just before, Rudy could suck me down his gullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.50,0:53:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我紧紧地抱住那个 悬在喉头的 软软的 粉粉的 肉肉的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grabbed hold of that, roast pink fleshy thing that dangles at the back of the throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.49,0:53:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我死死地抱着那玩意儿 并且前后摇摆 向后向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hung on to that sucker, and I swung back and forth, back and forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.16,0:53:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,向后向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back and forth, back and forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.21,0:53:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,向后…向前…向后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back... and forth and back. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.60,0:53:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,最后 我放开手 从他嘴里直直地射了出去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until finally I let go and shot right out of his mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.07,0:53:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那一回 我是瞎了一只眼 可我也得到了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have lost an eye that day. But I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.90,0:53:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁迪的牙齿…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rudy's tooth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.89,0:53:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就像老话说的"以牙还眼" 以下巴还鼻子 以屁股还…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the old saying: "An eye for a tooth". A nose for a chin. A butt for a"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.60,0:53:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是个俗语 算了 真的很俗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an old saying. But uh, it's not a very good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.59,0:53:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是超级黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} You are super weasel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.57,0:53:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 终极黄鼠狼 - 超能黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ultra weasel. - Diesel weasel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.28,0:53:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 他就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? He is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.37,0:53:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来 我给你们讲 当年 我是怎么用这把锋利的齿刀 把一头霸王龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let me tell you about the time I used to sharpen, clam-Shell to turn a T-Rex,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.93,0:53:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 治得服服帖帖 - 好的 大师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Into a T-Rachel - Yes master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 今晚的故事就到此为止吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that's enough fairy-Tales for one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.48,0:54:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 艾丽 你该休息了… - 唉 快乐的时光总是过得太快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Ellie. You should rest now... - Pff..Life at the party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.42,0:54:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你们去合合眼 我来守夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, you guys get some shut-Eye, I'll keep watch. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.35,0:54:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 巴克 有我们呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Buck, we got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.62,0:54:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,黑夜就是负鼠的天下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Night time is possum time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.79,0:54:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没错,我们是黑夜之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we own the night baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.37,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 鲁迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Rudy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.75,0:54:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait. What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.96,0:55:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝 明天有得忙呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep well, kids. We have a busy day tomorrow. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.73,0:55:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,锻炼 捕猎…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forging, Hunting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.50,0:55:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,想念朋友 估计他们不会想我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing my friends. Probably are not missing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.50,0:55:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么…?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What..?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.65,0:55:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是个软心肠 知道嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your a real softie. You know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.62,0:55:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.56,0:55:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,喀什? 艾迪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash? Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.34,0:56:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.46,0:56:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事? 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.42,0:56:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是想保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I just wanted to keep you safe, and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.07,0:56:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可如今 却害你困在这么危险的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're in the most dangerous place in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.51,0:56:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这又不是你的错 那只恐龙比我们两个加起来还大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't your fault. It's bigger than both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.04,0:56:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,, 我们必须去救希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.76,0:56:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 可如果当初我这个朋友能当得更够格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but If I had been a better friend to him... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.57,0:56:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不会在这儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we wouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.01,0:56:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,更够格? 你开什么国际玩笑?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better friend? Are you plucking my whiskers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.44,0:56:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你冒着你自己 你老婆 还有你孩子的生命危险 去救你这朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You risked your life, your mate and your baby to save your buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.91,0:56:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,或许算不上好丈夫或者好父亲 可是做朋友…够意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the best husband or father, but... a damn good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.49,0:58:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都停下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.20,0:58:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我闻到点什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.99,0:58:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有点像秃鹰的尾毛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, it smells like a buzzard's butt fell off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.45,0:58:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又被一群臭鼬放屁熏了一遍 - 就是希德没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And then got sprayed on by a bunch of, skunks. - That's, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.47,0:58:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们找到犯罪现场了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mammal's, we have ourselves a crime scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.06,0:58:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一撮臭烘烘毛 一根吃剩下一半的骨头!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tuft of fur. Half eaten carcass! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.47,0:58:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一坨…啊! 不妙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Hunk of...oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.96,0:58:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,菜花!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broccoli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.23,0:58:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为事情是这样的:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what I think happened: {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.99,0:58:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙袭击希德 希德用菜花反抗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinosaur attacked Sid, Sid, fights back with piece of broccoli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.89,0:58:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把恐龙 打成了植物龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving dinosaur, a vegetable. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.59,0:58:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你傻了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.76,0:59:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,希德可没那么暴力 也没这本事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid's not violent, or co-Ordinated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.31,0:59:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对啊 还有 恐龙呢? - 好了好了 算你们有理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah and where's the dinosaur? - Alright, alright. Good point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.60,0:59:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,场景重现2:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theory two:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.09,0:59:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,希德在吃菜花 恐龙吃掉希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid's eating broccoli. Dinosaur eats Sid. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.93,0:59:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,然后一脚踏扁菜花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinosaur steps on broccoli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.09,0:59:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,菜花就这样 成了一坨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving broccoli, a vegetable. ?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.73,0:59:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克 你什么时候疯得这么彻底了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck, when exactly did you lose your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.93,0:59:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…三个月前 我一觉醒来 发现自己和一个菠萝结婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Umm... 3 months ago. I woke up one morning married to a pineapple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还是一只巨丑无比的菠萝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An *UGLY* pineapple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.06,0:59:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可我还是爱它  - 呃 巴克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I loved her.  - Uh, Buck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.59,0:59:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,, 这边你好像漏了点线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I think you missed a little clue over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.08,0:59:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友或许还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Your friend might be alive. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.01,0:59:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可也活不久 鲁迪越来越近了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not for long. Rudy's closing in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.09,0:59:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.28,0:59:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧 "惊呼之地" 哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it. The plates of, wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.00,0:59:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,剩几块算几块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or whatever's left of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.36,1:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙排成一列 朝"熔岩瀑布"进发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Single file everyone. Head for, Lava Falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.35,1:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么声音? - 是风 它在和我们说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that sound? - It's the wind. It's speaking to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.13,1:01:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它说什么? - 我怎么知道 我又不是风语者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's it saying? - I don't know. I don't speak wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.87,1:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾丽? - 我没事 只是在…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ellie? - I'm fine, don't worry about me. I'm just taking my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.11,1:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.65,1:01:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼! - 快跳到旁边岩架上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manny! - Get to the ledge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.74,1:02:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.35,1:02:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽 你在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Ellie, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.74,1:02:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 我在上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I'm up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.20,1:02:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住 艾丽 我们马上就到!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Ellie. We'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.37,1:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我掉下来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Sloth down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.42,1:02:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等…暂停了 停下 天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait... Time out. Hold up. Jeez{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.55,1:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也太快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are getting fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.53,1:02:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿也还不赖嘛 气候宜人 邻里和睦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not so bad down here. Nice weather, friendly neighbours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.69,1:03:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 邻居{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, neighbour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.59,1:03:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是鲁迪… - 鲁迪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rudy... - Rudy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.35,1:03:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么没听过这种鬼哭狼嚎 - 那是希德! - 那我们要快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never heard that kind of dino, before. - That's, Sid. - We'll have to move fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.42,1:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼 菠萝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny. Pineapples. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.26,1:03:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,, - 菠萝 - 她是想吃水果了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} - Pineapples. - She gets cravings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.73,1:03:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,石榴 葡萄 油桃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pomegranates, grapefruits, nectarines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.91,1:03:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她这是在点果味鸡尾酒呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's ordering a fruit cocktail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.15,1:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 快想 桃子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, think. Peaches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.56,1:03:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,桃子…? 桃子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Peaches...? Peaches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.76,1:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 宝宝! 什…什么 现在? - 不妙啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The baby! What, what, what now...! - This not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.48,1:03:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子要生了 你们听见没有? 有时候我会幻听…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The babies coming. Did you guys hear that?  'Cause sometimes I imagine it in my head, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.27,1:03:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能忍忍吗? - 谁帮我扇他一下好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you try to hold it in! - Can somebody slap him for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.81,1:03:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坐好 我们就来! - 我们只能这么办了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just sit tight, we're coming! - There's only one thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.45,1:03:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,负鼠 你们跟我来 曼尼 你照顾好艾丽 等我们回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possums, your with me. Manny you take care of, Ellie until we get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.24,1:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 不行 你现在不能走 她掉队了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No you can't leave now. She's off the trail. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.26,1:03:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,, 你说的第二军规不算数了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about rule number 2?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,第五军规 在有女性的情况下 可忽略第二军规{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number 5 says, you can ignore rule number 2, if there's a female involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.68,1:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是有小狗狗的情况下 哎呀 反正我就是瞎编的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or possibly a cute dog. I just make up these rules as I go along. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.44,1:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是 可是 可是…她…你得…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but, but, but... she's... you have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.44,1:04:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼 别慌 我来照顾你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, it's alright. I got your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.19,1:04:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才对嘛,来吧孩子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Now your talking. Come on, lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.54,1:04:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这位先生 照顾好我们的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of our sister. Mr. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.02,1:04:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不要有压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.13,1:04:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这话有什么意思 "我来照顾你"? 我宁可他们能罩着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean, "I've got your back?", I'd rather they cover the front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.75,1:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刀枪箭雨可都是从外头来的 - 我们得抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's where all the good stuff is. - We gotta move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.12,1:04:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了! 没事了 老爸来了 老爸来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! Alright. It's okay. Daddy's, daddy's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.65,1:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 说实话 你可真会挑时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta say sweet heart, you really got timing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.00,1:05:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,走开! 快走开! 怕怕! 偶怕怕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away! Go away! Shoo! Afraid of danger! Afraid of danger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.31,1:05:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不要慌 不过是岩浆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, it's just lava. Deadly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.68,1:05:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要人命的岩浆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violent lava!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.10,1:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小伙子们! 准备好迎接冒险了吗? - 准备好了 长官!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boys! Are you ready for adventure? - Yes, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.53,1:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备好面对危险了吗? - 准备好了 长官!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For danger? - Yes, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.59,1:05:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备好拥抱死亡了吗! - 呃 你说啥 再说一遍?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For death! - Uhh, can you repeat the question? ?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.06,1:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样 来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.75,1:06:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你以前玩过飞行吗? - 没 这也是第一次!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you ever flown one of these before? - No, first time actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.95,1:06:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她在那 - 艾丽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There she is. - Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.90,1:06:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.77,1:06:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我得上到她那儿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.46,1:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听好 我去保护艾丽 你去挡住恐龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Listen, I'll protect, Ellie. You stop those guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.13,1:06:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼 如果让它们抓到她 就来不及了 你得相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, if they reach her, it'll be to late. You have to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.12,1:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 就这么定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.49,1:07:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我爪下生风啊 宝贝儿 爪下生风!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My paws are burning baby. They burning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.21,1:07:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我能踮脚跑 踮脚跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta, tip-Toe. Tip-Toe, Tip-Toe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.57,1:07:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,劳驾 踮脚跑那位 这里生孩子呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, twinkle toes. Giving birth here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.67,1:07:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对了 抱歉 你还好不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh right, sorry. You okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.17,1:07:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不太知道 不过曼尼就来了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I okay? Do you know anything about, child birth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.43,1:07:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不太知道 不过曼尼就来了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really, but Manny's coming..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.41,1:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈 我好怕 我能牵着你的脚掌吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego, I'm scared? Can I hold your paw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.90,1:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 当然了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, of course...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.13,1:07:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,忍着痛就好了 宫缩而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go with the pain. It's just a contraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.08,1:08:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看! 他在那! - 晓得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look! He's right there. - Roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.97,1:08:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,, - 不是 是希德 - 晓得!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, Sid. - I know, Roger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.82,1:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,, 要不我们先去救希德 然后再回来 救你的"小德"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bout we get, Sid first. And then go back for, Roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.90,1:08:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,算我什么都没说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.71,1:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 巴克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Buck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.50,1:08:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啊 希德在那边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait, Sid's that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.45,1:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟它们说去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell that to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.11,1:08:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来吧! 你们这群长鸡头的怪胎!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it on, you chicken headed freaks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.65,1:09:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 你做的很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about a thing. You're doing fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.17,1:09:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的 呃 失陪下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going great. Ah, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.91,1:09:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 注意呼吸 - 迪亚戈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just keep breathing. - Diego!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.25,1:09:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 调整呼吸就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just breathe, that's the important thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.09,1:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上弹药!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab that ammo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.41,1:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 标杆3点钟方向 - 开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bogey at 3'o clock. - Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.19,1:09:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太炫了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.61,1:10:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,崩紧了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.53,1:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,回见了 小鸟儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Hasta la vista, birdie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.92,1:10:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这就去…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get our...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.36,1:10:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,求救! 求救! 高度正在下降! 拉住这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday! Mayday! We're losing altitude! Hold these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.60,1:10:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一股子鱼腥味 - 好吧 你有没有觉得很囧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That tastes like fish. - Okay. That's just weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.55,1:10:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 哥们! - 我知道!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you, bro! - I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.67,1:10:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我醒过来! 快! 拉升!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snap out of it, come on! Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.86,1:10:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是我 树懒希德的安息之所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the end of, Sid the sloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.28,1:11:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命! - 别怕 希德 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help! - No, Sid. It's me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.63,1:11:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 还有我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And me! - And me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.45,1:11:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想让大伙陪我怕怕 可这东西是谁在开啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to panic anybody, but who's flying this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.45,1:11:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要 等等 我的孩子们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, wait, my kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.87,1:11:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我都没来得及说再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never even got to say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.81,1:11:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你办的到的 用力! 用力! - 我不行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can do it. Push! Push! - I can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.70,1:11:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one more big push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.46,1:11:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我现在有多不容易!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what I'm going through. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.43,1:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 当我没说过 我们一起推吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay forget I said that. Let's do this together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.75,1:12:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我更喜欢你们灭绝时候的样子 - 哦 我也有点晕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I liked you guys better, when you were extinct. - Oh, I'm getting dizzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.01,1:12:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼 快来 哥们 我估计快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny. Come on buddy. I think we're getting close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.22,1:12:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她可真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's perfect. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.55,1:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就叫她 艾丽吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should call her, Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.31,1:13:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小艾丽… - 我有个更好的…桃子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Little, Ellie... - I've got a better name... Peaches. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.95,1:13:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,桃子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peaches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.54,1:13:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有何不可? 她又可爱 又圆嘟嘟 还毛茸茸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not? She's sweet, and round, and covered with furs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"桃子" 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.14,1:13:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可看见喽 硬汉 - 哪里哪里 是被最后那只恐龙的爪子抓到了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I saw that, tough guy. - No, no, that last dino caught my eye with a claw and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.55,1:13:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我又不是铁石心肠 - 要降落了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alright, so I'm not made of stone. - Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.17,1:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是希德!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Sid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.03,1:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是个男孩!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, It's a boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.65,1:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是尾巴 - 是个女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it's tail. - It's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.71,1:13:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 小可爱 我是你希德叔叔 对哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, sweetheart. It's uncle Sid... Yes it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.33,1:13:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你可真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're so beautiful. Oh, she is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.90,1:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她长得像妈妈 真是谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looks just like her mother. Thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.55,1:13:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没别的意思 曼尼 你的心灵也很美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no offence, Manny, No offence. You're beautiful on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.34,1:13:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴你能回来 希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to have you back, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.31,1:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,以前真没想过 我会说这话…我很想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never thought I would say this, but... I missed you buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.31,1:14:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望我孩子也在这 这样你们就能做好朋友了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I wish my kids were here. You could have been friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.30,1:14:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.37,1:14:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说过不哭的 - 我可没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I promised myself I wouldn't cry. - I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.65,1:14:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,, 你呢? 有没有想过要个孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot what it was like to be part of a family. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.61,1:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢? 有没有想过要个孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you? Ever thought about having kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.82,1:14:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 该送你们回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, mammal's. Let's get you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.63,1:16:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 就是这儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it, mammal's. Right where you started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.39,1:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这趟下来真带劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.09,1:16:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,, 我们可以经常这样聚聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could make it a regular thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.78,1:16:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得这是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I don't know about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.65,1:16:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也对 也对 这里这么危险 不想来是自然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Right. Yes cos' of all the uh, mortal peril. Of-Course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.94,1:16:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,, 好了 巴克我就送你们到这了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, the Buck stops here! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.11,1:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,, 没你我们救不了希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't have done it without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.40,1:16:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是显然的了 不过 这些天真是很愉快…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well obviously. But, good times just the same...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.15,1:16:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不止我们 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not alone, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.61,1:16:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 鲁迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Rudy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.04,1:16:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.17,1:16:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看这边 你个大化石! 在找东西吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here you colossal, fossil! Looking for something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.05,1:17:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事就过来拿啊 快进山洞 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come and get it? To the cave! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.73,1:17:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 带着孩子呆着别动 - 我们没事 你快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay with the baby. - We'll be fine. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.87,1:17:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,软蛋龙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wuss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.81,1:17:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哈! 黄鼠狼在此!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pop, Goes the weasel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.90,1:17:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 嘘! 快! 给我飞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoo, shoo! Come on! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.27,1:17:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈…接着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego... Catch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.51,1:18:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 穿个洞 绕个圈 再打个结 - 拉吧 啊哈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Through the hole, over the valley. One more loop. - Come on lads, heev!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.64,1:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,下次好运了 小雪花 绳子绑不了它多久 快走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better luck next time, snowflake. This isn't Gonna hold him long. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.02,1:18:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大家等等我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.21,1:18:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 大龙妈妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, mom-Zilla!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.01,1:19:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,过来点 宝宝 我告诉你们啊 这里才是你们的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, kids. Well let me tell you something. You're where you belong now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.14,1:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们长大一定会是 又高又大 又让人怕怕的大恐龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm sure you're gonna grow up to be giant, horrifying dinosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.35,1:19:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟你们的妈妈一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.99,1:19:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Momma...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.75,1:19:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好我们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take good care of our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.22,1:20:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是个好家长 希德 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You were a good parent, Sid. - Thank's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.23,1:20:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能给你家当保姆吗? - 想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I baby-Sit for you. - Not a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.60,1:20:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 不要这样嘛 我可以低薪上岗 - 好了 我考虑考虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh come on, I work cheap. - Alright, I'll think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.76,1:20:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太棒了! - 当这事没发生过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! - Never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.74,1:20:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了 我现在该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.  What am I supposed to do now? .{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.04,1:20:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.38,1:20:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.10,1:20:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,, 你是说…上去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean... up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.21,1:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想过再回去 在这儿呆久了 都习惯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought of going back. I've been down here so long, it feels like up to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.51,1:20:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道自己还能不能适应地上的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I can fit-In up there anymore. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.05,1:20:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我们几个 你觉得我们像是正常的一帮子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So look at us. We look like a normal herd to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.09,1:21:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了 大块头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.64,1:21:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,到我们了 来吧 桃子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our queue. Come on peaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.40,1:21:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.52,1:21:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克…?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.13,1:21:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我…我想… - 我懂…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I... I gotta... - Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.41,1:21:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再说 这地方还是别让人知道的好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides this world should really stay down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:22:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 照顾好他们 虎兄 - "永远服从巴克"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take care of 'em, tiger. - "Always listen to, Buck."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.18,1:22:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快出洞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're almost out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.95,1:22:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家都没事吧? - 巴克人呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is everybody, okay? - Where's Buck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.20,1:22:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 他在他想在的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. He's where he wants to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.79,1:22:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那他没事吧? - 你开玩笑吧 那黄鼠狼可死不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he going to be okay? - Are you kidding? Nothing can kill that weasel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.31,1:22:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是在担心鲁迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, Rudy I'm worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.94,1:23:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 家有儿女这种事你不适应 不过 无论你做什么决定…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this baby thing isn't for you. But whatever you decide to do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.64,1:23:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不走了 伙计 探险人生…这里就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving, buddy. Life of adventure... It's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.30,1:23:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我还准备了一大篇演讲呢 练了好久 你这样让我怎么表现得既强壮又细腻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I got a whole speech here. I've been working on it. How can I show you that I'm strong and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.38,1:23:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,既高尚 又温柔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensitive? Noble, yet caring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.14,1:23:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.10,1:23:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 小家伙长得真快 对吧? 想想我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, they grow so fast, huh? Look at my kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.37,1:23:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好像是昨天才出生 今天就走了 - 他们就是 希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seems they were born one day and then gone the next. - They were, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.60,1:23:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 养孩子真辛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it was a lot of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.04,1:24:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 宝贝 欢迎来到冰川世纪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right, sweetheart. Welcome to the Ice Age.{\r}
